-- A `.a` link needs an alias for the same reason a `.so` link does —
-- nothing else could name it in `emit ... to <name>`. Resolved identically
-- in both output modes (loader.rs's nm scan and alias check run before
-- either backend ever sees the program), so this is a plain `fail_`
-- fixture, not `buildonly_`.
link "native_modules/test_math_static.a"
